<translation id="3115238746683532089">Umkhiqizo ongaziwa ongu-<ph name="PRODUCT_ID" /> kusukela kumthengisi ongu-<ph name="VENDOR_ID" /> (inombolo yomkhiqizo engu-<ph name="SERIAL_NUMBER" />)</translation>
<translation id="3144135466825225871">Yehlulekile ukufaka esikhundleni sefayela le-crx. Hlola ukuze ubone uma ngabe ifayela lisetshenziswa.</translation>
<translation id="3163201441334626963">Umkhiqizo ongaziwa ongu-<ph name="PRODUCT_ID" /> kusukela kumthengisi ongu-<ph name="VENDOR_ID" /></translation>
