<translation id="7876803335449432072">Ayikwazanga ukulayisha ifayela elithi '<ph name="RELATIVE_PATH" />' leskripthi sekhontenti, amashidi esitayela eskripthi sekhontenti singalayishwa kuphela ukusuka kumafayela eshidi lesitayela asekelwayo njengamafayela okuthi .css.</translation>
<translation id="7939686037314084444">Isandiso sihlulekile ukulayisha ngokufanelekile. Kungenzeka singakwazi ukuhlangabeza izicelo zenethiwekhi.</translation>
