<translation id="8761756413268424715">I-"<ph name="APP_NAME" />" icela ukufinyelela kweyodwa  yamadivayisi akho.</translation>
<translation id="8885905466771744233">Ukhiye oyimfihlo wesandiso esicacisiwe sowuvele ukhona. Phinda usebenzise loyo khiye noma wususe kuqala.</translation>
